# ─── Vitest integration-test environment ───────────────────────────────────────
# These values are the WELL-KNOWN local-development credentials produced by
# `supabase start` (CLI v1.x and v2.x). They are deterministic across every
# Supabase install — the JWT keys are signed with the documented dev secret —
# so they are safe to commit. They do NOT grant access to any Cloud project.
#
# To run integration tests:
#   1. Ensure Docker is running (e.g. `open -a OrbStack` or `open -a Docker`)
#   2. `npm run supabase:start`  (first time also auto-applies migrations)
#   3. `npm run test:integration`
#
# Reference: https://supabase.com/docs/guides/cli/local-development

